# websiteAsBirthdayGift

## Project structure

```text
websiteAsBirthdayGift/
├── .git/                 # Git configuration
├── .gitignore            # files ignored by Git
├── index.html            # main web page file
├── package.json          # project dependencies and configuration
├── package-lock.json     # npm dependency lock file
├── readme                # project documentation
├── node_modules/         # installed npm dependencies
├── public/               # public project resources
│   ├── icon.png
│   └── markerIcon.png
├── src/                  # project source code
│   ├── assets/           # multimedia and visual resources
│   │   ├── audio/
│   │   └── photos/
│   ├── js/               # frontend logic
│   │   ├── frontpage.js
│   │   ├── map.js
│   │   └── sidebar.js
│   ├── py/               # Python scripts
│   │   └── Organizer.py
│   └── styles/           # site styles
│       └── style.css
└──
```

## Overview

This project is a birthday gift website with a simple structure based on HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, along with a Python script used to organize or prepare data related to the site content.

- The visual and interactive part is located in the src folder.
- Public files such as icons are stored in public.
- The main entry point of the site is index.html.
- Project dependencies are managed through package.json.
